{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "group-data",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -36,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 1432,
      "height": 3410,
      "label": "01 · Мы оставили следы",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary-question",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/01-ordinary-question.svg",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ordinary-question-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 924,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**01 · Этот вопрос выглядел слишком простым.**\n\n[Реальный вопрос · Stack Overflow · 2009](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/480214/how-do-i-remove-duplicates-from-a-list-while-preserving-order)"
    },
    {
      "id": "internet-textbook",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/02-internet-textbook.svg",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "internet-textbook-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**02 · Мы написали учебник. Не договариваясь.**\n\n[The Pile · GitHub и Stack Exchange в составе корпуса · 2020](https://arxiv.org/html/2101.00027v1#S2.S8)"
    },
    {
      "id": "signal-not-noise",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/03-signal-not-noise.svg",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "signal-not-noise-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3164,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**03 · Но повторить интернет — ещё не научиться.**\n\n[FineWeb · 2024](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.17557) · [Удаление дубликатов · 2021](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06499)"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-ideas",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1564,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 1432,
      "height": 6770,
      "label": "02 · Как научить машину",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "write-the-rules",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/04-write-the-rules.svg",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "write-the-rules-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 924,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**04 · Первая мысль: запишем все правила.**\n\n[Дартмутское предложение · 1955](https://www-formal.stanford.edu/jmc/history/dartmouth/dartmouth.html)"
    },
    {
      "id": "learn-frequencies",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/05-learn-frequencies.svg",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "learn-frequencies-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**05 · А если правила спрятаны в примерах?**\n\n[От n-грамм к нейросетевой модели · Bengio et al. · 2003](https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v3/bengio03a.html)"
    },
    {
      "id": "learn-representations",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/06-learn-representations.svg",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "learn-representations-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 3164,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**06 · Похожие задачи могут делиться опытом.**\n\n[Нейросетевая языковая модель · 2003](https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v3/bengio03a.html) · [Seq2seq · 2014](https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.3215)"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 3360,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/07-attention.svg",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 4284,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**07 · Не сжимать всё в одну подсказку.**\n\n[Bahdanau, Cho, Bengio · attention для перевода · 2014](https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.0473)"
    },
    {
      "id": "transformer",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 4480,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/08-transformer.svg",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "transformer-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 5404,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**08 · 2017. Изменили способ считать.**\n\n[Attention Is All You Need · 2017](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762)"
    },
    {
      "id": "scale",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 5600,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/09-scale.svg",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "scale-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 6524,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**09 · Одной архитектуры оказалось мало.**\n\n[Scaling Laws · 2020](https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.08361) · [Few-shot learning · 2020](https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.14165)"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-llm",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3164,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 1432,
      "height": 5650,
      "label": "03 · Что происходит внутри",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "training",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/10-training.svg",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "training-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 924,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**10 · Миллиарды задач с готовой подсказкой.**\n\n[Нейросетевое языковое моделирование · 2003](https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v3/bengio03a.html) · [Баланс данных и вычислений · 2022](https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.15556)"
    },
    {
      "id": "tokens",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/11-tokens.svg",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tokens-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**11 · Для модели здесь не два слова.**\n\n[Токенизаторы и числовые ID](https://huggingface.co/learn/llm-course/en/chapter2/4) · [Исходный токенизатор примера](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B)"
    },
    {
      "id": "inside-llm",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/12-inside-llm.svg",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "inside-llm-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 3164,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**12 · Внутри — преобразования чисел.**\n\n[Архитектуры Transformer](https://huggingface.co/learn/llm-course/en/chapter1/6)"
    },
    {
      "id": "generation",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 3360,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/13-generation.svg",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "generation-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 4284,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**13 · Код рождается продолжением контекста.**\n\n[Стратегии генерации](https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/generation_strategies)"
    },
    {
      "id": "instruction-following",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 4480,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/14-instruction-following.svg",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "instruction-following-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 5404,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**14 · Продолжать текст и помогать — разные задачи.**\n\n[InstructGPT · обучение по человеческой обратной связи · 2022](https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.02155)"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-code",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 4764,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 1432,
      "height": 3410,
      "label": "04 · Почему получается код",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "why-code-works",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/15-why-code-works.svg",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "why-code-works-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 924,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**15 · Почему это часто работает именно с кодом?**\n\n[Исследование генерации кода · 2021](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374)"
    },
    {
      "id": "execution",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/16-execution.svg",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "execution-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**16 · У кода есть преимущество: его можно запустить.**\n\n[Python · порядок элементов dict](https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#dict) · [Оценка функциональной корректности · HumanEval · 2021](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374)"
    },
    {
      "id": "historical-proof",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/17-historical-proof.svg",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "historical-proof-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4800,
      "y": 3164,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**17 · Поворот: измерять результат исполнения.**\n\n[Codex / HumanEval · исходная работа · 2021](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374) · [AlphaCode · поиск, фильтрация и новые задачи · 2022](https://deepmind.google/blog/competitive-programming-with-alphacode/)"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-agents",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 6364,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 1432,
      "height": 2290,
      "label": "05 · Когда текст стал действием",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-loop",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/18-agent-loop.svg",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-loop-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 924,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**18 · Следующий ответ может быть действием.**\n\n[ReAct · действия и наблюдения · 2022](https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629)"
    },
    {
      "id": "beyond-code",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/19-beyond-code.svg",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "beyond-code-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6400,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**19 · Тот же цикл работает за пределами кода.**\n\n[GAIA · исследование задач с инструментами · 2023](https://arxiv.org/abs/2311.12983)"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-decisions",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 7964,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 1432,
      "height": 4530,
      "label": "06 · А если нужен только выбор?",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "classification-before-chat",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/20-classification-before-chat.svg",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "classification-before-chat-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 924,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**20 · Выбирать класс машины умели давно.**\n\n[AlexNet · классификация и GPU · 2012](https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/2012/hash/c399862d3b9d6b76c8436e924a68c45b-Abstract.html)"
    },
    {
      "id": "bounded-decision",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/21-bounded-decision.svg",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bounded-decision-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 2044,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**21 · Генерировать строку — только один выход.**\n\n[OpenAI · принцип Decisions API](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/decisions) · [TypeSafe · типизированные решения](https://docs.typesafe.ai/introduction)"
    },
    {
      "id": "calibration",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/22-calibration.svg",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "calibration-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 3164,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**22 · Вероятность — обещание о серии случаев.**\n\n[TypeSafe · смысл вероятностей и confidence](https://docs.typesafe.ai/confidence) · [Калибровка нейросетей · 2017](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.04599)"
    },
    {
      "id": "why-now-decisions",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 3360,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 900,
      "file": "01-foundations/01-from-data-to-agents/assets/story/23-why-now-decisions.svg",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "why-now-decisions-sources",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8000,
      "y": 4284,
      "width": 1360,
      "height": 124,
      "text": "**23 · Почему эта ветка стала заметна сейчас?**\n\n[TypeSafe · исходное объявление Jev · 15 сентября 2026](https://typesafe.ai/blog/introducing-system-one-models-and-jev) · [OpenAI · официальный принцип ограниченных ответов](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/decisions)"
    }
  ],
